description: Prefer hyphens over em/en dashes in all project writing
alwaysApply: true
---

# No em dashes or en dashes

Do not use em dashes (`—`) or en dashes (`–`) in UI copy, comments, README, commits, or generated text.

Use a regular hyphen-minus (`-`) instead.

```text
❌ Kleo Docs — Document Chat
✅ Kleo Docs - Document Chat

❌ Persist in the background — don't block
✅ Persist in the background - don't block
```

When editing existing files, replace any `—` / `–` with `-`.
